lope.\" ; owl:inverseOf :containsMessage .\n\n# ... (repeat for all other inverses, ensuring rdfs:label is always a short name, and rdfs:comment is always a description)\n\n#################################################################\n# Segment-Specific Properties, Disjointness, Equivalence, Restrictions\n# ... (as previously, with harmonized class/property names)\n#################################################################\n"
